WEBVTT

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:07.870
Thanks for waiting. We will now begin the WBC World Middleweight Title Match!

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.040
This is it, eh?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.470
Good. I done made it in time?

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:18.990
"I done"?

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.500
Nekota-san! You came?!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.370
What the hell took you? You missed our fights!

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.500
Are yew kidding? I sure as heck watch yer fights.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.840
Those were some mighty fine KO's.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.720
<i>He didn't see it.</i>

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.690
Where'd that Makunouchi go?

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.510
He was so nervous he had to use the restroom.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:42.020
I have to run, or else I won't see his entrance!

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.270
Wait!

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.310
Miyata-kun!

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.840
Congratulations on your KO win!

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.400
You can save it.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.700
There's something more important I need to ask you.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.200
It's about Takamura-san.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:14.480
Eye problems?

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:15.990
Yes.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:18.990
Probably his right eye.

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:23.490
He'll need a diagnosis, but in the worst-case scenario, he has a detached retina.

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:25.650
Y-You're kidding!

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:27.620
If that's true, he can't fight any matches!

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.820
I'm just voicing my suspicions.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:34.330
Have you noticed any changes with Takamura-san?

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:35.620
I don't know.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:40.350
Hopefully there's none, then it could be just a groundless fear.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.640
But if by some outside chance that's actually the case, then I'm afraid...

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.450
we'll have to stop the match.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:49.140
His entire career would be in jeopardy.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:57.150
The challenger will now proceed to the blue corner!

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.240
Here he is!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.900
The former WBC Junior Middleweight Champion, Takamura Mamoru!

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.620
{overlap}Yeah!

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:10.170
This real go-getter, who said sweeping two weight classes is just a mere "passing point," is approaching the battlefront!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.820
I know you love these huge stages.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.670
Now raise hell like only you can.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.170
Yeah!

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:26.040
Let's go, Takamura!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.070
I'm counting on you!

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:28.600
You're the champion!

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.580
You'll win!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.690
There's no way you can lose this!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:35.790
And now the champion will proceed to the red corner!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:40.990
Takamura's tough, you know!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:42.700
Just leave your belt and scram!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:48.170
The Olympic gold medalist, who later made it to the top of the heap after only 15 professional fights.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:50.100
All he knows is glory.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.710
However,

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:54.850
his natural talents are impeccably honed by his hard work and determination!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.460
The Super Champ is standing before Takamura!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:03.830
And here he is, the Golden Eagle, David Eagle!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:10.230
In the red corner, weighing in at 158 and three-quarter pounds,

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:14.020
the American WBC Middleweight Champion,

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:18.000
David "Golden" Eagle!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:23.190
In the blue corner, weighing in at 160 pounds and hailing from Kamogawa Gym,

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.990
the third-ranked WBC Middleweight boxer,

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:30.000
Takamura Mamoru!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.540
I hope you're all right, Takamura-san.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.040
You see that?

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.040
See what?

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.050
That belt!

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:46.350
Quit looking so greedy! You'll be getting it soon, old man!

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.970
I'm not the one who's getting it!

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.520
So you don't want it?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.790
N-No, I do.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.770
You say something?

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.520
Dammit! I said I want it!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.070
Is that right? So you <i>do</i>  want it?

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.710
Both fighters are beckoned to the center.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:07.280
Will Takamura sweep two weight classes?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:10.540
Or will the champion crush his ambitions?

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.700
<i>The man's too slick.</i>

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.090
<i>And he was goofing off just a second ago.</i>

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.760
The referee's done giving out instructions, 
and both fighters return to their respective corners.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:31.100
And now, the match you've all been waiting for is about to begin!

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:34.490
Keep your eyes peeled! He's going to come out swinging!

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:35.560
Who?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.100
Both of them!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.570
There's the bell!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:54.120
It's Hawk vs. Eagle! The battle between the two biggest birds of prey is on!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.450
The champion's left strike!

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.540
That jab looked like a straight!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.340
<i>Too soft!</i>

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.050
The challenger's left hand comes heavy!

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.800
<i>I ain't sizing you up!</i>

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.800
<i>Be prepared to be pounded backwards!</i>

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.260
The lefts come back and forth! But no clean hit!

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:22.270
Though those punches still put you on edge!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.280
They're both trying to overpower the other.

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:27.280
If one can accomplish that, he'll have all the momentum he needs.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.060
It's fine!

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:33.300
If he can match those speeds, his right eye isn't posing a problem!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.020
Yeah.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:39.170
In any case, whoever wins this tit-for-tat will maintain the advantage.

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:41.670
The champion got hit!

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.590
Takamura has the opening hit!

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:47.260
Followed by a right hand!

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.780
It just scratched the cheek!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.890
The champion is jumping back!

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.100
He's certainly getting more cautious!

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:59.600
After that exchange of lefts, the champion is putting up a guard!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.610
<i>He's turned into a goddamn baby box turtle.</i>

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:05.360
<i>I'm gonna tear that shell apart!</i>

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:09.320
The challenger goes in!

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.860
Those hits pack a lot of power!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:13.610
Yes! He's got the initiative!

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:17.370
Maybe it's because he's back to the middleweights, but he seems a lot stronger now.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.580
<i>That's a tight guard, all right.</i>

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.590
<i>But... his body's laid bare for my hits!</i>

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:28.590
<i>However, that cool gaze of his doesn't sit right with me.</i>

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.590
<i>Does he want me to go for the body? Or...</i>

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.100
Whoa! The challenger's hit the ropes!

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:44.860
He's the one who went in, but over time...

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:48.610
There are several ways of putting the pressure on someone.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.110
One way is to corner someone without using your fists.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:56.370
Takamura will definitely not be fighting this kind of match.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:01.370
When that happens, his one weakness might get exposed.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.290
A weakness?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.880
It's an objective fact that Takamura is a natural when it comes to slugfests.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:11.130
His animal instincts in hunting down his prey are truly one of a kind.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.290
But this is boxing, not a street brawl.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:17.890
When one's caged in a ring, there's one thing that can beat those instincts.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:20.390
The champion approaches him slowly!

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.060
<i>You asshole!</i>

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:25.440
<i>You made it look like I ran away scared!</i>

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.990
The challenger goes flying in again!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.780
But the champion puts his guard up!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.160
<i>The body's open.</i>

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.280
<i>Is he baiting me?</i>

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.780
<i>What now?</i>

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:41.500
<i>He ain't baiting me! He's just desperately blocking me!</i>

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:44.500
<i>I can just dig into his body and take the fight!</i>

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.750
<i>No!</i>

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.210
<i>That's what a stupid scrub would think!</i>

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:50.880
<i>But I'm taking the hard road since I'm that good!</i>

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:56.010
<i>I'll show you I'm nothing like your other opponents!</i>

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.260
Wow! What a counter!

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.520
He just barely dodged it!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.160
What was that?!

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.020
That straight looked like a javelin!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.090
I-If he took that...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.530
That was close.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:16.120
<i>Dammit! So he was looking for a head shot?</i>

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.660
<i>He's frickin' clever.</i>

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.770
He gives an icy stare through the guard!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.120
Now the pressure's on the challenger!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.460
<i>I'm not being pressured!</i>

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.630
<i>Come on! I'm letting you hit me!</i>

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.460
He's taunting him!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.380
He has his guard down and a "punch me" sign up!

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:36.960
But the champion isn't biting!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:39.390
Instead, he's maintaining his cool stare!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:40.540
<i>Shithead!</i>

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.680
<i>You think you can win without hitting?!</i>

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.400
It's the challenger who loses patience!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.270
His wild punches are coming north and south!

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.700
And he responds in kind!

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.200
Those rights come in like rapid-fire ordinance!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.220
However, the challenger nimbly ducks them...

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.600
But that's the bell and the end of the first round!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.590
So you smelled danger and started hitting back?

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.800
You would, wouldn't you?

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:21.930
What is it, Takamura?!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:25.180
That bastard was eyeing me, wasn't he?

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.390
God, I hate him.

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.660
What do you think?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.070
Stop talking!

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.700
Focus on your breathing.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:36.240
<i>He saw it... all throughout the last round.</i>

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.440
You better pay attention!

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.530
You know the other guy is going to step it up!

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:45.130
Don't worry, I'll hand him his ass sooner than you think!

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:49.920
I'll show the world how powerful I am now that I'm back in my original weight class!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.960
Okay, we're right on track.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:56.650
Just keep doing what you're supposed to do in the next round.

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:58.860
Seconds out!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.470
Round Two!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.480
The challenger once again comes hurtling in!

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:11.190
And he's upping the pace!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:13.220
Yes! Go, mow him down!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.150
You're this close to the sweep!

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.730
Damn, could he really win this?

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.080
I think so.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.170
He will! {-daniyo Also from S2 - Juggen}

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:22.160
Come on, go for it!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.600
I've never seen Takamura-kun hitting this stride!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.470
His punches and movements are both at top form.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.200
He's in the best possible shape we can imagine!

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.200
However...

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:37.090
Despite taking that blistering attack, Eagle isn't anywhere near the ropes.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.050
He's still parked at the center of the ring.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:43.840
He's the champion, all right. He knows if he takes even one step backwards, he's done for.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.550
Is that all you see?

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:49.560
He's doing things slightly different from the first round.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.560
He switched from arm blocks and parries to...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.070
mainly shoulder blocks.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:00.070
And he's carrying himself at closer range.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:04.570
So the reason why Eagle looks calm under that assault is...

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:10.580
He's handling all those blows because now he knows Takamura's rhythm like the back of his hand.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.150
His rhythm?

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:15.380
And we can now assume he knows how to deal with him.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.210
Then that means...

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:17.840
Yep.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.110
It's coming!

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:31.100
The champion with a straight right!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.650
<i>What the...?</i>

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:43.610
He's instantly blasted into a corner! Is he now on the defensive?

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:48.120
His style of boxing takes advantage of Takamura's huge weakness.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:52.870
It's this trait which has won him the gold medal and the belt.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:55.380
You can't beat him using raw strength alone.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:59.880
You must remain two or three moves ahead in this high-level chess game.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.380
Don't punch without thinking!

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:13.600
The champion connects at the tail end of the challenger's punches! And accurately too!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:18.970
Wow! He's got Takamura-san's rhythm down and is getting clean hits!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:21.320
It's not the only thing he has down.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.000
He also has down his personality.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.040
That's why he's not putting a lot of weight into those punches.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:29.990
No weight? Why?

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:32.870
If he did that, he could cause a lot of damage!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.410
<i>Why...</i>

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.250
<i>are his punches so damn soft?!</i>

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.840
<i>Quit looking at me!</i>

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:45.380
<i>Again?</i>

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:48.280
He's not taking the opportunity to hurt him.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:51.350
Takamura has sure as hell gotten the message!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.290
Of course, he must be angry.

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.080
Wow, look at that swing!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.400
Go get him! One hit will put him down!

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.390
It's no use! Those huge swings can't get him!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:05.360
Yes. And it's exactly what he wants.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.490
<i>Another light one?</i>

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.540
<i>That seals it.</i>

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.370
<i>So this guy is really...</i>

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:15.080
<i>pulling punches on me?!</i>

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.660
<i>Goddamn you!</i>

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:21.840
That one's real!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:23.000
I knew it!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.010
<i>He was waiting for him to get sloppy?</i>

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:29.010
<i>You little punk!</i>

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.520
Oh, he's hurting! He felt that last one!

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:37.020
Takamura!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.440
Oh, god!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:41.400
<i>You shitstain! Now my legs aren't working!</i>

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:43.440
<i>Move!</i>

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.240
<i>This again?</i>

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:53.280
How can Takamura-san get cornered this easily?!

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.520
He's good!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.050
Dumbass! Don't praise his opponent!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.580
And here comes the champion!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.840
This is his first onslaught of the match!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.670
The challenger is completely stuck!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.840
<i>He pulled back his punches when he was in real trouble.</i>

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.180
<i>Then he hits hard when I do huge swings.</i>

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:14.680
<i>And all the while, he blocks off my escape routes.</i>

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.090
<i>Low risk and high return.</i>

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.360
<i>That's very smart boxing.</i>

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.480
<i>And a pain in the ass!</i>

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:25.940
<i>Who the hell can box while thinking about strategy?!</i>

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:29.460
Whoa! What do you call these punches?

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:32.490
What power from some very awkward positions!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:37.040
<i>If you think you got me all figured out, think again!</i>

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:40.830
<i>I'm going to bust open that smartass head of yours!</i>

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:45.300
<i>Animal instinct versus reason. So that's what it's come to.</i>

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.860
Takamura-san is full of surprises!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.050
That guy's beyond reason!

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:51.940
The champion's shellshocked!

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:52.910
Take him down!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.050
Go get him!

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:57.570
The champion's throwing some solid lefts!

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:00.500
But the challenger's too quick!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:06.150
And he makes a completely unconventional attack from an impossible angle!

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.140
So close!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.110
Almost!

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.200
Keep pushing!

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.670
That's the end of the second round!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.100
The champion floated in mid-air!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.190
If he didn't block him, he'd be done for!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.700
He's sure to hit him!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.720
Yeah, count on it!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.820
That stupid counter pissed me off!

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:43.270
It made my damn legs numb!

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.730
So Eagle does know how to punch!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.980
Of course he does! He's the world champion!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.200
He still makes me puke.

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:55.720
Boxing isn't a damn shogi game!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:58.110
You box with your fists!

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:01.990
People are not supposed to win matches when they have to think about it!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:04.170
Especially when facing me!

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:11.170
Takamura! Takamura! Takamura!{ad infinitum}

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:10.610
We're at the third round! The whole arena's behind the challenger!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:15.650
So close!

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:16.840
You almost had him!

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:21.720
If only that one landed!

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:23.480
Get him, Takamura!

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.980
Eagle's only barely checking him with his left!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:32.740
It's only a matter of time before Takamura-san lands a good one!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.990
Do y'all think so?

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.000
He's down!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:55.010
<i>He's got us right in the palm of his hand!</i>

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:56.970
One!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:16:59.210
Two!

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.550
Three!

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.320
H-He went down!

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:05.900
He was going for the kill, but then got knocked back before we knew it!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.080
Four!

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:06.550
Five!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:09.520
He's good! The champion is really good!

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:08.890
Six!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.150
Seven!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.680
Oh! He's up!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.530
The damage appears to be minor!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.030
But...

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:20.690
Take a look at his face!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:24.040
He looks like a monster whose pride has been shattered!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.160
The champion makes a slow approach!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.540
The challenger goes in with no guard!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:32.300
He's angry! That man's obviously upset!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.970
Those full swings are full of rage!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.760
One of those could turn someone into mush!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:39.970
The killer punches keep coming!

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:43.510
But they're not connecting! They keep hitting thin air!

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:45.190
Those are powerful, all right.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:47.520
Those huge punches won't get him!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:51.020
Hey, cool it! The champion's going for a counter!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.870
I've never seen Takamura-kun like this!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.150
He seems very disorganized to me!

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:00.240
He <i>is</i>  disorganized.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.780
This is a man who loathes being put in a box.

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:07.290
But he's been manipulated throughout the entire match... straight into a box.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.790
He must feel thoroughly humiliated.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:15.750
It's like watching a hawk thrash around in a locked cage.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.550
He got him!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:37.070
The challenger grabbed the ropes to avoid a down!

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:39.820
And that's where the third round ends!

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:45.580
The champion calmly walks away! His back seems to say it's all going according to plan!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:51.080
Who would have thought the Japanese Hawk would be toyed with in this fashion?!

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:54.540
The Golden Eagle has an air of perfection around him!

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:57.000
He thinks it's in the bag!

00:18:57.000 --> 00:19:00.490
I hate to admit it, but his boxing game's at another level.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.090
God, what a mismatch.

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:06.100
This is now your game to lose! You were perfect all the way!

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.200
Just as you guessed, he's just like Hawk.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.890
He only relies on his talents and violent strength.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.420
He's no match for your experience and diligence.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.610
Now go make easy work of him!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.570
I'm fighting for dear life.

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:22.610
Eagle?

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:25.210
I am struggling just to survive!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:31.370
I get chills down my spine whenever I dodge one of his blows.

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:37.720
Do you have any idea the amount of nerves it takes just to go for a counter?

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.770
Wipe the sweat!

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.390
Don't let our opponents get a whiff of this!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:50.390
<i>To think that Takamura's punches would make Eagle this spooked.</i>

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:51.960
Takamura-kun, gargle!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.240
No, you need to breathe first!

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.900
Will you all shut up!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:58.860
Don't worry about me!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.360
You telling me you have a plan?

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.820
Yeah!
